WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.667
-We love our audience.
You watch us every night.

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:05.567
But right now, we want to change
things up and watch you.

00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:06.901
