00:00:06.901 --> 00:00:09.467
to send us some fun
or unique talents that you have.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:11.400
We got submissions
from thousands of people

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.634
all across the world.

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:13.868
And we're going to meet
some of them now.

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:16.334
It is time for
"Show Me Something Good."

00:00:16.334 --> 00:00:18.467
-♪ Show me something good ♪

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:20.567
♪ Show me something good ♪

00:00:20.634 --> 00:00:22.834
♪ Show me something good ♪

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:24.234
♪ Show me ♪

00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:26.267
-Alright.
Let's meet our first guest.

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:27.767
Hello. Come on over.
Hi.

00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:29.501
-Hi.
-Nice to see you.

00:00:29.501 --> 00:00:31.033
-Nice to meet you.
-Thanks for being here.

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:32.234
-No problem.
Thanks for having me.

00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:33.567
-What is your name,
and where you from?

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:34.901
-My name is Ajiea Hargrave.

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.868
I'm originally from
Reading, Pennsylvania,

00:00:36.868 --> 00:00:37.868
