00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:40.334
-Hey, L.A.
There you go. Come on.

00:00:40.334 --> 00:00:44.701
And, Ajiea, what talent will you
be sharing with us tonight?

00:00:44.701 --> 00:00:48.334
-So, I was gonna do a back tuck
and put these shorts on midair.

00:00:48.334 --> 00:00:50.200
-So, wait, you're gonna
do a back tuck,

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.601
which is a flip, right?
-Yep.

00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:54.000
-A back tuck
and put the shorts on midair.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.334
-Yep.
-I'm ready to see this.

00:00:55.334 --> 00:00:56.701
Do you need anything?
Can I help you?

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:59.100
-Yeah. Actually, I'm gonna
need a trampoline.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:00.434
-We got a trampoline
right there.

00:01:00.434 --> 00:01:01.801
-Oh, okay, good.

00:01:01.801 --> 00:01:03.400
-Ajiea, whenever you're ready.
-Alright.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.901
-I'm gonna stand back.

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:07.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.701
[ Drum roll ]

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.767
Here we go.
Come on.

00:01:12.467 --> 00:01:15.000
Come on!
[ Laughs ]

00:01:19.901 --> 00:01:23.067
Oh!

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:24.300
Yes!

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:25.968
That is how you do it!

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:27.601
Come on, now!
-Thank you.

00:01:27.601 --> 00:01:29.567
-That is how you do it.

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:34.834
Can we see that --
Can we see that in slow motion?

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:37.334
Whoa, yes!

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:40.133
Come on. Fantastic.
-Thank you.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.801
-Thank you, thank you,
thank you so much.

00:01:41.801 --> 00:01:42.968
-Thank you, thank you.

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:45.434
-Now let's meet our next guest.

00:01:45.434 --> 00:01:46.834
Come on over here.
Hello. Hey.

00:01:46.834 --> 00:01:48.501
What is your --

00:01:48.501 --> 00:01:50.567
Thanks for being here.
-Nice to meet you.

00:01:50.567 --> 00:01:52.467
-Well, what is your name
and where are you from?

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:54.567
-Mada Graviet.
I live in Salt Lake City, Utah.

00:01:54.567 --> 00:01:55.601
From Richmond, Virginia.

00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:57.067
-Hey. Alright.
-Yeah.

00:01:57.067 --> 00:02:02.934
-Now, Mada,
I saw what you're gonna do,

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:05.200
but I don't want to spoil it
and ruin it for anyone.

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:08.501
So, do you just want to just
walk us through and just --

00:02:08.501 --> 00:02:10.067
-Yeah, yeah.
-Just leave it at that.

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:12.734
But get ready
to have your mind blown.

00:02:12.734 --> 00:02:14.067
-Something like that.
You said talent.

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:15.968
It's more of a party trick.
-Yeah.

00:02:15.968 --> 00:02:17.234
-All you need
is Fruit by the Foot.

00:02:17.234 --> 00:02:18.734
-Okay. Fruit by the Foot.
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:19.734
-Yeah.
-One good nostril.

00:02:19.734 --> 00:02:21.501
-Not an ad.
Not an ad.

00:02:21.501 --> 00:02:23.133
-Not yet.
-No.

00:02:23.133 --> 00:02:25.234
-Okay.
Start off like this.

00:02:25.234 --> 00:02:26.400
-Okay, Fruit by the Foot.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:27.634
-Yeah, only one way
to open them.

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:29.033
-That's correct.
Oh, that's it.

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:30.767
-Yeah.
-That's the one, yeah.

00:02:30.767 --> 00:02:32.801
-So, you don't really need
the treat,

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:35.601
but it's fun to munch on
while you're rolling it up.

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:36.734
-Okay.
So, yeah, so...

00:02:36.734 --> 00:02:38.167
-We'll just place that
right there.

00:02:38.167 --> 00:02:39.968
But that doesn't do us any good.
-So, the fruit goes there.

00:02:39.968 --> 00:02:41.534
-Yeah.
You start with this.

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:43.834
This little -- the rolled side.

00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:44.834
-The rolled side, yeah.
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:44.834 --> 00:02:46.400
You're just gonna take it.
-Okay.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:48.167
-Gonna start rolling it up.
-Okay.

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:50.167
-Takes a minute, though.
-Oh, yeah, go for it.

00:02:50.167 --> 00:02:51.868
Take your time.
-Rolled some for us, though.

00:02:51.868 --> 00:02:53.501
-Oh, you have some rolled.
-I got some rolled.

00:02:53.501 --> 00:02:55.000
It definitely --
It takes a sec.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.033
So, I got some
pre-rolled for us.

00:02:57.033 --> 00:02:59.567
-Pre-rolled
Fruit by the Foot roll.

00:02:59.567 --> 00:03:01.367
Yeah. Alright.
So, thank you. Pre-rolled.

00:03:01.367 --> 00:03:04.300
-So take it like this.
Poor word choice.

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.734
-It's legal now in New York,
so it's fine.

00:03:06.734 --> 00:03:08.434
-I know. Whenever I started
this, people were like,

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:10.334
