are you doing there?"

00:03:10.334 --> 00:03:11.567
-So, you have this.
Yeah, sure.

00:03:11.567 --> 00:03:13.501
-Pick a nostril.
-Okay.

00:03:13.501 --> 00:03:14.868
-Kinda gotta...

00:03:14.868 --> 00:03:17.734
[ Drum roll ]

00:03:17.734 --> 00:03:19.567
