00:03:30.667 --> 00:03:32.567
-No. Let's try --
Here, let's try one together.

00:03:32.567 --> 00:03:33.634
-Let's do it.
-Can I do one?

00:03:33.634 --> 00:03:35.434
Just take this.
Any nostril?

00:03:35.434 --> 00:03:37.033
-You might --

00:03:37.033 --> 00:03:38.467
One three. Oh.

00:03:38.467 --> 00:03:39.734
That's pretty good!

00:03:39.734 --> 00:03:41.601
That's probably
better than mine.

00:03:41.601 --> 00:03:44.167
Better than mine.
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:44.167 --> 00:03:45.300
You taught me.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:46.868
